title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: party_organizations_timer += 4;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the SPD runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @culture: Sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @rb: The Reichsbanner, our self-defense organization.
- @youth: The youth organizations.
- @feminism: The women's organizations.
- @nothing: We do not need to address our organizations.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
subtitle: Our newspapers [? if radio > 0: and radio ?] can be used for spreading our message.
go-to: org_media

@welfare
subtitle: We can manage our mutual aid network to provide relief to the unemployed. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among them. ?]
go-to: org_welfare

@culture
subtitle: Contribute to various organizations that sustain the cultural life of our electorate.
go-to: org_culture

@rb
subtitle: Contribute to our self-defence organization, Reichsbanner Schwartz-Rot-Gold.
view-if: not rb_explode
#on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength  += 100; rb_militancy += 0.01; reichsbanner_timer = 0; funded_reichsbanner += 1
go-to: reichsbanner

@youth
subtitle: We have a reputation as a party for old men.
view-if: not rb_explode
#on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; left_strength += 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;
go-to: org_jusos

#Our new youth members flock to the left or neorevisionist wings of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the Reichsbanner.

@feminism
subtitle: Look into socialist feminist organizations.
go-to: org_feminist

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
